# Pro-only assets never belong in this repo — it is public, and they are the paid
# differentiator. The free build strips images/pro via stripProAssets(); 39 files from
# before that pipeline existed were still tracked and served (2026-08-27).
templates/*/images/pro/
**/LICENSE-PRO.md
*-pro-static.zip
*-pro-source.zip

# Local social-card working file, never deployed
fb-cards.html
fb-cards/

# Pro workbook builds are parked outside the public site until they ship to Gumroad.
# See the free-kits-and-pro-holding-pattern memory. Nothing here should ever be committed.
spreadsheets/pro-pending/
**/pro-pending/
